repository-code: https://github.com/Donald-1974/morphogenesis-suite
abstract: >
  Interactive MAC–SPH–turgor tri-coupled solver. Lagrangian particles
  carry mass. An Eulerian MAC grid enforces incompressibility. A Poisson
  turgor field steers form. Computational morphogenesis only — no
  biological interpretation.
keywords:
  - morphogenesis
  - MAC
  - SPH
  - PIC/FLIP
  - Poisson
  - turgor
  - computational physics
